---
// v2/src/components/astra/FAQ.astro
---
<section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading" class="w-full"><nav aria-label="Section 09, FAQ" class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1200px] items-center justify-between border-b border-ink/10 px-5 py-5 md:px-12 md:py-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="label text-ink/50">09</span><span class="label text-ink">FAQ</span></div><button type="button" class="group/next label flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-transparent py-2 pr-2 pl-4 text-ink transition-colors duration-500 ease-dentea hover:border-ink/30">Next<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3.5 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea group-hover/next:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/next:-translate-y-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></nav><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1200px] flex-col gap-10 px-5 py-20 md:flex-row md:gap-16 md:px-12 md:py-28"><div class="md:w-1/3"><h2 id="faq-heading" data-anim="lines" class="display display-italic text-[16vw] opacity-0 md:text-[7vw]">FAQ</h2></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col"><dl data-anim-group="true" data-anim-stagger="0.05" data-anim-from="20" class="flex flex-col"><div class="border-b border-ink/12"><dt><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-panel-0" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="display text-[1.2rem] md:text-[1.6rem]">How long does a brand identity take?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea rotate-45 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id="faq-panel-0" class="grid transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea"><p class="serif-body max-w-[52ch] pb-6 text-[1.05rem] md:text-[1.2rem]">Most identities take twelve to sixteen weeks from the first workshop to final files. Packaging, signage and websites add time, and we plan all of it up front so nothing surprises you.</p></dd></div><div class="border-b border-ink/12"><dt><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-1" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="display text-[1.2rem] md:text-[1.6rem]">What does a project cost?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 shrink-0 text-ink/50 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id="faq-panel-1" hidden="" class="grid transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea"><p class="serif-body max-w-[52ch] pb-6 text-[1.05rem] md:text-[1.2rem]">Every project is quoted as a fixed fee after a first conversation. Identities usually start around twenty thousand euros, and the proposal lists exactly what is included.</p></dd></div><div class="border-b border-ink/12"><dt><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-2" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="display text-[1.2rem] md:text-[1.6rem]">Do you work with new businesses?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 shrink-0 text-ink/50 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id="faq-panel-2" hidden="" class="grid transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea"><p class="serif-body max-w-[52ch] pb-6 text-[1.05rem] md:text-[1.2rem]">Often. Several of the brands in our work started with us before they had a product on a shelf. We only ask that the founders are closely involved.</p></dd></div><div class="border-b border-ink/12"><dt><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-3" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="display text-[1.2rem] md:text-[1.6rem]">What do we receive at the end?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 shrink-0 text-ink/50 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id="faq-panel-3" hidden="" class="grid transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea"><p class="serif-body max-w-[52ch] pb-6 text-[1.05rem] md:text-[1.2rem]">Master logo files, colour and type specifications, templates, print-ready artwork and a set of brand guidelines. You own everything we make for you.</p></dd></div><div class="border-b border-ink/12"><dt><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-4" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="display text-[1.2rem] md:text-[1.6rem]">Can you work with our in-house team?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 shrink-0 text-ink/50 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id="faq-panel-4" hidden="" class="grid transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea"><p class="serif-body max-w-[52ch] pb-6 text-[1.05rem] md:text-[1.2rem]">Yes. We regularly design the system and hand it to an internal team, then stay on call for reviews and the occasional difficult piece.</p></dd></div><div class="border-b border-ink/12"><dt><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-5" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="display text-[1.2rem] md:text-[1.6rem]">Do you only work in Paris?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 shrink-0 text-ink/50 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id="faq-panel-5" hidden="" class="grid transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea"><p class="serif-body max-w-[52ch] pb-6 text-[1.05rem] md:text-[1.2rem]">No. The studio is in Paris, but most of our clients are elsewhere in Europe and further afield. We travel for workshops and shoots, and work remotely in between.</p></dd></div></dl><div class="pt-10"><a class="group/pill label inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 ease-dentea active:scale-[0.98] py-2 pr-3 pl-4 border-ink/40 bg-transparent text-ink hover:border-ink hover:bg-ink/5" href="/faq">All FAQs<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 transition-transform duration-500 ease-dentea group-hover/pill:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section>
